/// Lint-only carrier for schema evidence exclusions.
///
/// Prisma generation, migration, and ERD inputs do not include this `.schema`
/// file. Keep real `@evidence` directly above its owning model. Add
/// reviewed exclusions here in the form shown below without the `Example:`
/// prefix.
///
/// Example: @evidenceExclude docs/analysis/example.md#section The schema intentionally stores no state for this requirement.
